  "balance_warnings": [
    "prod_growth must stay <= 1.02. With linear production, any prod_growth above ~1.02 makes each level RELATIVELY cheaper and the game completes itself in minutes.",
    "Judge pacing by 'days until generator N', never by payback seconds — payback SHRINKS as levels rise, which is normal and desirable.",
    "First prestige must land on day 2-4. Earlier wastes the reveal; later and players churn before seeing the meta loop.",
    "The prestige multiplier must not plateau inside 30 days. A sqrt curve plateaus; the 0.4-power curve does not.",
    "click_value is coupled to GPS (5% of raw GPS per tap). If you raise that, the generator ladder collapses — clicks out-earn idle income.",
    "Keep the cheapest cosmetic within the first 20 minutes of play. An unreachable store is an untested store."
  ],
